      "statement": "The default client configuration sets tls:true, logLevel:Warning, logger:console, waitIceCandidatesTimeout:2000, autoAnswer:true, autoAcceptAnswer:true, maxReconnectAttempts:10, maxReconnectRounds:2, reconnectBaseBackoffMs:250, and rtcConfig to Google STUN servers with bundlePolicy 'balanced', all overridable via the Config interface.",
