      "statement": "sendOffer and sendAnswer both delegate to the shared negotiateWithPeer helper, which merges per-call RTC options by spreading into a fresh local object ({ ...config.rtcOfferOptions, ...rtcOfferOptions }) instead of mutating the shared config, so call-site options cannot leak into the stored config.rtcOfferOptions.",
